* [ ] We can create a combined `aria-labelledby` attribute
* [ ] No axe-core errors, including missing or mis-labelled IDs
* [ ] Updated documentation recommending teams pass a unique ID
* [ ] Verify the combined accessible label announces in screen readers (VoiceOver, iOS VoiceOver, NVDA)

