Issue https://github.com/opensearch-project/OpenSearch/issues/11753 points out the configuration of `terminate_after` may result some data loss on dropdown list query results for OSD. Recently I also discovered some of the other issues by doing the following experiment.

## Issue 1 - The default configuration of `terminate_after` return unexpected `null` as results

