<EuiFlexGroup gutterSize="s" alignItems="center">
  <EuiFlexItem grow={false}>
    <IntervalSelector ... />
  </EuiFlexItem>
  <EuiFlexItem grow={false}>
    <BreakdownFieldSelector ... />
  </EuiFlexItem>
</EuiFlexGroup>
```

### State Management

The breakdown field selection will be managed through Redux state:

